# devices: duo
# Merged Chats and Projects across computers; Manage Projects once. Offline fixtures only, no sends.
# Duo taps and drags are gated (#387): the sidebar and Manage Projects open by launch flags; the Settings > computer > Projects link is captured on iPhone and iPad.
hinge 0
orient portrait

launch --fixture subagent-fixture --fixture chat-layout --fixture chat-layout-unsaved --fixture project-actions --fixture several-computers --fixture theme --arg cupola-light --fixture sidebar-open
wait --id sidebar-search --timeout 30
shot a-merged-chats-duo-folded-cupola-light-projects-several

